msgid "Profit by Product Category (last 12 months)"
msgstr "Lucro por categoria de produto (últimos 12 meses)"

#: includes/brikpanel-store-summary.php:2442
msgid ""
"A product filed under several categories contributes its full revenue to "
"each of them, so these rows overlap and their sum exceeds store revenue. "
"Margin is blank where no product in the category has a cost on file."
msgstr ""
"Um produto classificado em várias categorias soma toda a sua receita a cada "
